.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH geectl-build-results 1  "geectl-build-results 0.3.0" 
.SH NAME
geectl\-build\-results \- Read the build\-results matrix for a project
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgeectl build results\fR [\fB\-\-package\fR] [\fB\-\-repository\fR] [\fB\-\-arch\fR] [\fB\-\-code\fR] [\fB\-\-multibuild\fR] [\fB\-\-local\-link\fR] [\fB\-\-last\-build\fR] [\fB\-\-oldstate\fR] [\fB\-\-all\-instances\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIPROJECT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the build\-results matrix for a project
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-package\fR \fI<PACKAGE>\fR
Only this package\*(Aqs statuses (the repository/architecture cells still come back whole)
.TP
\fB\-\-repository\fR \fI<REPOSITORY>\fR
Only these repositories (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-arch\fR \fI<ARCH>\fR
Only these architectures (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-\-code\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Only packages with this build code (e.g. `failed`)
.TP
\fB\-\-multibuild\fR
Expand multibuild flavors into their own statuses
.TP
\fB\-\-local\-link\fR
Follow local links when expanding multibuild flavors
.TP
\fB\-\-last\-build\fR
The last build\*(Aqs results instead of the current state
.TP
\fB\-\-oldstate\fR \fI<OLDSTATE>\fR
Poll for changes since this state hash — a polling token from a previous `results` run\*(Aqs payload. Only `results` takes it: `wait\-for\-results` polls plainly
.TP
\fB\-\-all\-instances\fR
Merge the results from every configured instance into one view, instead of only the instance currently pointed at. Cannot combine with `\-\-oldstate`: a state hash is per instance. A partially\-failing read still exits 0: per\-instance errors render in the view and payload, and only an every\-instance failure is an error
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIPROJECT\fR>
The project to read
.SH VERSION
v0.3.0
